{TEXT("反坦克枪携弹手"),TEXT("Tank-rifle bearer")},
{TEXT("反坦克枪携弹手"),TEXT("Tank-rifle bearer"),TEXT("反坦克枪副射手")},
{TEXT("反坦克枪携弹手"),TEXT("Tank-rifle bearer"),TEXT("Anti-Tank Rifle Bearers")},
{TEXT("枪榴弹携弹手"),TEXT("Rifle-Grenade Bearers")},
{TEXT("前沿电话所"),TEXT("Forward Telephone Posts")},
{TEXT("前沿电话线"),TEXT("Forward Telephone Lines")},
{TEXT("大攻势之间，巡逻、抓俘与修壕从未停止。康布雷战区的冬季前沿依靠夜间巡逻辨认敌军换防，也在短促出击中争夺观察与联络。"),TEXT("Between major offensives, patrols, prisoner raids and trench work never stopped. Winter patrols around Cambrai identified changes in the opposing garrison and fought short actions for observation and communications.")},
{TEXT("塞勒河战役将百日攻势带进湿润河谷、道路与铁路切口。德军后卫掩护撤运，协约国部队继续向桑布尔方向推进；每一条仍能通行的路线都受到争夺。"),TEXT("The Battle of the Selle carried the Hundred Days into wet valleys, roads and railway cuttings. German rear guards covered evacuation as Allied forces advanced towards the Sambre. Every remaining route became contested ground.")},
{TEXT("湿润河谷中，路堤提供局部掩护。铁轨两侧的浅沟和残存障碍限制通行。"),TEXT("The embankment offers cover in the wet valley. Shallow ditches and remaining obstacles limit movement beside the tracks.")},
{TEXT("湿润河谷中，路堤提供局部掩护。铁轨两侧的浅沟和残存障碍限制通行。"),TEXT("The embankment offers cover in the wet valley. Shallow ditches and remaining obstacles limit movement beside the tracks."),TEXT("湿润河谷被路堤切开，铁轨两侧的旧障碍与浅沟通向狭窄接近线。")},
{TEXT("湿润河谷中，路堤提供局部掩护。铁轨两侧的浅沟和残存障碍限制通行。"),TEXT("The embankment offers cover in the wet valley. Shallow ditches and remaining obstacles limit movement beside the tracks."),TEXT("An embankment divides the wet valley; old obstacles and shallow ditches beside the rails lead into narrow approaches.")},
// V50 current-date historical situations
{TEXT("阿拉斯的炮声穿过雨雪，英军正向德军前沿推进。白垩高地遮住了远处枪位；洞穴、交通壕和仍在回答的电话，将守军的各个支点连在一起。"),TEXT("The guns at Arras carry through sleet as British infantry move towards the German front. Chalk heights conceal the farther gun positions. Caves, communication trenches and the telephones still answering link the defending posts.")},
{TEXT("勒厄守着阿拉斯以东的道路。化工厂、铁路堤和地下掩体彼此照应，炮火打碎的砖墙后仍有机枪；前沿部队正在争夺通向厂区的接近壕。"),TEXT("Roeux guards the roads east of Arras. The chemical works, railway embankment and underground shelters support one another. Machine guns remain behind the shattered brick walls as the forward companies contest the approach trenches.")},
{TEXT("布勒库尔的兴登堡防线前，澳大利亚与英国部队再次集结。四月战斗留下的残骸散在铁丝间，德军纵深壕仍与后方连通；枪榴弹开始落向胸墙。"),TEXT("Australian and British troops assemble again before the Hindenburg Line at Bullecourt. Wreckage from the April fighting lies among the wire. German trenches remain connected to the rear as rifle grenades begin to fall around the parapets.")},
{TEXT("凌晨的地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。普卢默的第二集团军沿炮兵计划推进，澳大利亚与新西兰部队也在其中；新弹坑之间，幸存枪位仍在寻找彼此。"),TEXT("The dawn mine explosions tear open Messines Ridge. Plumer's Second Army advances behind its artillery plan, with Australian and New Zealand troops among the attackers. Between the new craters, surviving gun positions try to recover contact.")},
{TEXT("梅西讷的新前线尚未稳固。英军和澳新部队调整枪位、修补胸墙，德军反击队在东面集结。"),TEXT("The new front at Messines is not yet secure. British and ANZAC troops reposition guns and repair parapets while German counterattack parties gather to the east.")},
{TEXT("梅西讷的新前线尚未稳固。英军和澳新部队调整枪位、修补胸墙，德军反击队在东面集结。"),TEXT("The new front at Messines is not yet secure. British and ANZAC troops reposition guns and repair parapets while German counterattack parties gather to the east."),TEXT("梅西讷的新前线尚未稳固。英军与澳新部队忙着转向枪口、修补胸墙，德军反击队在东面集合；坑岸上的新路还来不及铺好。")},
{TEXT("梅西讷的新前线尚未稳固。英军和澳新部队调整枪位、修补胸墙，德军反击队在东面集结。"),TEXT("The new front at Messines is not yet secure. British and ANZAC troops reposition guns and repair parapets while German counterattack parties gather to the east."),TEXT("The new front at Messines remains unsettled. British, Australian and New Zealand troops turn their guns and rebuild parapets while German counterattack parties assemble to the east. The fresh paths along the crater rims are still unfinished.")},
{TEXT("皮尔克姆方向的进攻已经展开。伊普尔周围的排水沟被炮火打断，雨水漫进田野和旧弹坑；送弹队与伤员只能挤向少数仍能通行的道路。"),TEXT("The attack towards Pilckem is under way. Shellfire has broken the drains around Ypres, and rain spreads into the fields and old shell holes. Ammunition parties and casualties converge on the few roads that remain passable.")},
{TEXT("朗厄马尔克前方，农场废墟和混凝土据点散在湿地里。相邻部队隔着积水接近各自目标，德军机枪沿剩下的干路组织射界；炮兵观察员正在辨认新的落点。"),TEXT("Ruined farms and concrete posts dot the wet ground before Langemarck. Neighbouring formations approach their objectives across the flooded fields. German machine guns cover the remaining dry routes while artillery observers identify fresh aiming points.")},
{TEXT("梅宁路两侧的林地已被炮火削成木桩。英军把炮兵计划集中在有限的推进地段，德军预备队在更深处待命；林缘、坡脊与残存小路决定各枪位能看见什么。"),TEXT("Shellfire has reduced the woods beside the Menin Road to stumps. British fire plans concentrate on limited advances, while German reserves wait in depth. Woodland edges, ridges and surviving paths determine what each gun position can see.")},
{TEXT("康布雷近郊的道路与铁路通向一座重要补给枢纽。坚实田地上布满履带印，兴登堡防线的铁丝和纵深壕横在其间；步兵与炮兵正争夺这些接近线。"),TEXT("The roads and railways around Cambrai lead to an important supply centre. Tracks mark the firm fields between the Hindenburg Line's wire and deep trenches. Infantry and batteries contest the approaches to these communications.")},
{TEXT("德军反击威胁康布雷突出部。布尔隆林缘的道路仍在运送弹药、接替部队和伤员，英军正部署机枪保护通路。"),TEXT("German counterattacks threaten the Cambrai salient. Roads along Bourlon Wood still carry ammunition, relief troops and wounded men. British machine guns are being placed to protect the route.")},
{TEXT("德军反击威胁康布雷突出部。布尔隆林缘的道路仍在运送弹药、接替部队和伤员，英军正部署机枪保护通路。"),TEXT("German counterattacks threaten the Cambrai salient. Roads along Bourlon Wood still carry ammunition, relief troops and wounded men. British machine guns are being placed to protect the route."),TEXT("德军反击正挤压康布雷突出部。布尔隆林缘的道路承载着弹药、接替部队和撤出的伤员，英军机枪转向新的威胁；各支部队都在争取让交通继续流动。")},
{TEXT("德军反击威胁康布雷突出部。布尔隆林缘的道路仍在运送弹药、接替部队和伤员，英军正部署机枪保护通路。"),TEXT("German counterattacks threaten the Cambrai salient. Roads along Bourlon Wood still carry ammunition, relief troops and wounded men. British machine guns are being placed to protect the route."),TEXT("German counterattacks press against the Cambrai salient. Roads beside Bourlon Wood carry ammunition, relieving troops and wounded men. British machine guns turn towards the new threat as each formation struggles to keep its communications moving.")},
{TEXT("康布雷前线的冬季巡逻、抓俘和修壕仍在继续。前哨借夜色查探敌军换防，巡逻队沿雨雪中的脚印前进。"),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue at Cambrai. Outposts investigate enemy reliefs by night as patrols follow tracks through the sleet.")},
{TEXT("康布雷前线的冬季巡逻、抓俘和修壕仍在继续。前哨借夜色查探敌军换防，巡逻队沿雨雪中的脚印前进。"),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue at Cambrai. Outposts investigate enemy reliefs by night as patrols follow tracks through the sleet."),TEXT("冬季的康布雷前线仍在修壕、抓俘和巡逻。雨雪把脚印留在铁丝前，前哨借夜色查看对方是否换防；寂静只持续到第一声枪响。")},
{TEXT("康布雷前线的冬季巡逻、抓俘和修壕仍在继续。前哨借夜色查探敌军换防，巡逻队沿雨雪中的脚印前进。"),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue at Cambrai. Outposts investigate enemy reliefs by night as patrols follow tracks through the sleet."),TEXT("Winter at Cambrai still means trench work, prisoner raids and patrols. Sleet preserves tracks before the wire. Outposts use the darkness to learn whether the opposing garrison has changed; silence lasts only until the first shot.")},
{TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势在浓雾与密集炮火中展开。英军第五集团军守着宽阔正面，德军突击队寻找支点之间的薄弱处；电话交换所与道路交叉口都在遭受轰击。"),TEXT("Operation Michael opens in thick fog and concentrated shellfire. British Fifth Army holds a broad frontage as German assault parties search for weak points between the posts. Telephone exchanges and road junctions are under bombardment.")},
{TEXT("利斯河低地响起新的德军炮击，葡萄牙与英军阵位正承受进攻。河沟切开了平缓田野，弹药车依赖少数道路；邻段失去联络的消息不断传到连部。"),TEXT("A fresh German bombardment falls across the Lys lowlands as Portuguese and British positions come under attack. Drainage ditches divide the flat fields, leaving ammunition wagons dependent on a few roads. Reports of lost contact reach the companies.")},
{TEXT("维莱布勒托讷扼守通向亚眠的道路。德军步兵与坦克攻向村庄，英国装甲在近郊迎战；破墙、果园和路口之间，双方正争夺能够观察敌车的位置。"),TEXT("Villers-Bretonneux commands the road towards Amiens. German infantry and tanks attack the village while British armour engages outside it. Among broken walls, orchards and junctions, both sides contest positions from which they can observe the opposing vehicles.")},
{TEXT("亚眠清晨的雾里，澳大利亚与加拿大部队向东展开，英军在左侧、法军在南侧行动。炮兵、坦克和航空观察按同一张时刻表工作，德军前沿正设法接回失联枪位。"),TEXT("In the morning mist at Amiens, Australian and Canadian troops move east, with British forces on the left and French forces to the south. Guns, tanks and aerial observation follow one timetable as German posts try to restore contact.")},
{TEXT("斯卡尔普方向的攻势再次进入白垩田野。加拿大军越过旧阵地，德军后卫依托铁丝和村落组织防御。工兵须清除通路上的未爆弹。"),TEXT("The Scarpe advance returns to chalk fields. Canadian troops cross old positions while German rearguards defend behind wire and villages. Pioneers must clear unexploded shells from the approaches.")},
{TEXT("斯卡尔普方向的攻势再次进入白垩田野。加拿大军越过旧阵地，德军后卫依托铁丝和村落组织防御。工兵须清除通路上的未爆弹。"),TEXT("The Scarpe advance returns to chalk fields. Canadian troops cross old positions while German rearguards defend behind wire and villages. Pioneers must clear unexploded shells from the approaches."),TEXT("斯卡尔普方向的推进重新进入白垩田野。加拿大军正越过旧有阵地，德军后卫依托铁丝与村落组织火力；翻出的未爆弹散在工兵要打开的通路上。")},
{TEXT("斯卡尔普方向的攻势再次进入白垩田野。加拿大军越过旧阵地，德军后卫依托铁丝和村落组织防御。工兵须清除通路上的未爆弹。"),TEXT("The Scarpe advance returns to chalk fields. Canadian troops cross old positions while German rearguards defend behind wire and villages. Pioneers must clear unexploded shells from the approaches."),TEXT("The advance beside the Scarpe returns to chalk country. Canadian troops cross old positions while German rear guards organise their fire around wire and villages. Unexploded ammunition lies on the routes that pioneers must open.")},
{TEXT("圣康坦运河与兴登堡防线横在前方。贝利库尔隧道上方，澳大利亚和配属美军正在进攻；草坡掩住地下通路，地表铁丝与枪位仍保护着各处出口。"),TEXT("The St Quentin Canal and Hindenburg defences lie ahead. Australian and attached American troops attack above the Bellicourt tunnel. Grass slopes conceal the underground passage, while wire and gun positions protect the exits at the surface.")},
{TEXT("塞勒河的渡口、路堤和铁路切口正在遭受争夺。德军后卫掩护物资与部队后撤，协约国炮兵寻找能压住河谷的观察位置；湿冷天气让每条通路都更加拥挤。"),TEXT("Crossings, embankments and railway cuttings along the Selle are contested. German rear guards cover the movement of stores and troops while Allied batteries seek observation over the valley. Cold, wet conditions crowd every usable route.")},
{TEXT("加拿大军正在逼近瓦朗谢讷，城镇里仍有平民。守军占住外围道路与枪位，协约国炮兵重新核对射界；军车、手推车与担架共用城外的通路。"),TEXT("Canadian troops approach Valenciennes, where civilians remain inside the town. The defenders hold the outer roads and gun positions while Allied batteries check their fields of fire. Army wagons, handcarts and stretchers share the approaches.")},
{TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。"),TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire.")},
{TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。"),TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire."),TEXT("桑布尔方向的进攻正在展开，新西兰部队已接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫枪位仍挡在前方；西线尚未停火，各连继续接收当天的作战命令。")},
{TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。"),TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire."),TEXT("The Sambre offensive is under way, and New Zealand troops approach the walls of Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited streets and rear-guard guns still bar the routes. The Western Front has not ceased fire; companies receive their orders for the day.")},
